            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A mist generator device (400) for delivering a mist to a user, the mist generator device (400) for use with a driver device (202). The mist generator device (400) comprises a housing (204) comprising a liquid chamber (218), the liquid chamber containing a liquid to be atomised, the liquid comprising a therapeutic. A sonication assembly (425) is coupled to the housing (204) the sonication assembly (425) comprising an ultrasonic transducer (215), a first assembly portion (426) and a second assembly portion (428) coupled to the first assembly portion (426). At least one of the first assembly portion (426) and the second assembly portion (428) comprises a resiliently deformable section that forms a seal between the first assembly portion (426) and the second assembly portion (428) which minimises or prevents a fluid from leaking between the first assembly portion (426) and the second assembly portion (428).</p>
            </abstract>
